This is just the original tdlib (the library for building Telegram clients) +
the spec file, which allows to build tdlib in Sailfish OS OBS with a config
like this:

<services>
  <service name="tar_git">
    <param name="url">https://github.com/monich/tdlib.git</param>
    <param name="branch">master</param>
    <param name="revision">0ce806c</param>
  </service>
</services>
